/E (This project presents a computer-vision-based skin tone detection and foundation recommendation system. By combining facial landmark analysis, KMeans clustering, and LAB color matching, it accurately identifies the most suitable foundation shades from various brands. The system promotes inclusivity and personalization in the cosmetics industry, bridging the gap for underrepresented skin tones and ensuring better product satisfaction.)
